Sòti ekri: ['txt equals Ceasar Salad = '] + ( txt = ['Ceasar Salad'] ), nouvo-liy.
Sòti ekri: ['txt does not equal Word Salad = '] + ( txt ≠ ['Word Salad'] ), nouvo-liy.
Sòti ekri: ['txt does not equal Ceasar Salad = '] + ( txt ≠ ['Ceasar Salad'] ), nouvo-liy.

